2. Services used, not redistributed
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following are used as hosted services over their public interfaces. No code
belonging to them is present in this repository, and nothing here is a derivative
work of them.

  Google Cloud - Cloud Run (the two deployed services in project
    provenance-agentic-2026, region us-east4), Cloud Build and Artifact Registry
    (image build and image storage), and Secret Manager, which holds every
    credential the two services read and mounts each one by reference rather
    than passing it on a command line
    Copyright Google LLC
  The Gemini Developer API, reached with a Google AI Studio key -
    gemini-3.7-flash and gemini-3.5-flash-lite for reasoning and extraction,
    gemini-3.6-flash as the capacity fallback. gemini-embedding-2 is probed
    and canonical but NOT in use: the 18,035 corpus vectors are Titan at
    VECTOR(1024) and migration 0009, which widens the column for it, is
    deliberately unapplied. No Vertex AI, no service account, no IAM.
    Copyright Google LLC
  CockroachDB Cloud, the ccloud CLI and the cockroach SQL CLI
    Copyright Cockroach Labs, Inc.
  Amazon Web Services - Amazon Bedrock, whose amazon.titan-embed-text-v2:0
    produced the 18,035 corpus vectors committed to this repository before the
    pivot. Nothing here calls Bedrock while serving a request, and the deployed
    system holds no AWS credentials.
    Copyright Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates

The CockroachDB Cloud Managed MCP Server is NOT used, and the earlier version of
this file listing it was wrong. The MCP server in this repository is the
project's own, built on the Model Context Protocol Python SDK listed above and
serving the five agent_*_v1 views to pv_agent_reader; ops/probes/README.md
records the Managed MCP Server claim as blocked.

